@startuml getForwardingDomainListAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getForwardingDomainListAsync – Retrieve List of Forwarding Domains
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "ControlConstruct" as ccRes #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
   To retrieve all forwarding-domain entries.
end note

requestor -> ccRes: (none)
activate ccRes

ccRes -> jd: read forwarding-domain list
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct
jd --> ccRes: forwarding-domain list
deactivate jd

note over ccRes
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Retrieve all forwarding-domain entries  
  - Return array of forwarding-domain objects  
  - Return empty array if none exist
end note

ccRes --> requestor: Array of forwarding-domain objects | []
deactivate ccRes

@enduml
